[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): Ten shadows have fallen into the soil. Their silence is not peace.
"Dianthus Core": Moonspore clings to them because even void-born things carry traces of night-blooming life.
"Dianthus Core": I feel an old road waking beyond the meadow. The Ruins of Veld remember what the darkness took.
"Dianthus Core": Follow that memory while the day still belongs to us.
